WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.455
[MUSIC PLAYING]

00:00:06.880 --> 00:00:10.390
SPEAKER: To get started with the
Cloud Translation API for cURL,

00:00:10.390 --> 00:00:13.330
you need a GCP project, which
you can set up in the Console.

00:00:17.110 --> 00:00:18.970
Enable the Google
Cloud Translation

00:00:18.970 --> 00:00:23.080
API for that project, and
then create a service account

00:00:23.080 --> 00:00:26.050
and download the
private key as JSON.

00:00:26.050 --> 00:00:29.380
You use these credentials
to access Google Cloud APIs.

00:00:29.380 --> 00:00:32.587
So be sure to keep this file
secure and out of your code

00:00:32.587 --> 00:00:33.295
and public repos.

00:00:36.840 --> 00:00:39.810
To securely access the
credentials from your project,

00:00:39.810 --> 00:00:42.360
go to the terminal, and
set an environment variable

00:00:42.360 --> 00:00:44.170
to the path of your
service account.

00:00:46.910 --> 00:00:50.820
If you don't yet have the Cloud
SDK installed on your machine,

00:00:50.820 --> 00:00:53.030
then install and initialize it.

00:00:53.030 --> 00:00:55.910
Instructions are linked below.

00:00:55.910 --> 00:01:01.020
Use curl to make a request to
the translation.googleapis.com

00:01:01.020 --> 00:01:03.130
endpoint.

00:01:03.130 --> 00:01:07.160
The curl command includes JSON,
with the text to be translated,

00:01:07.160 --> 00:01:10.550
the language to translate
from, and the language

00:01:10.550 --> 00:01:12.530
to translate to.

00:01:12.530 --> 00:01:15.230
The source and target
languages are identified

00:01:15.230 --> 00:01:19.730
using the iso-639-1 codes.

00:01:19.730 --> 00:01:23.070
The source language is
English-- in this case, en--

00:01:23.070 --> 00:01:26.330
and the target language
is Spanish, es.

00:01:26.330 --> 00:01:30.680
The format of the query is
noted as text, for plain text.

00:01:30.680 --> 00:01:32.390
Run the curl command,
and you should

00:01:32.390 --> 00:01:35.770
see this as your response.

00:01:35.770 --> 00:01:36.970
Congratulations.

00:01:36.970 --> 00:01:39.610
You have made your first request
with the Cloud Translation

00:01:39.610 --> 00:01:41.650
API for cURL.

00:01:41.650 --> 00:01:43.540
To find out more about
the client libraries

00:01:43.540 --> 00:01:45.790
or consult translation
basics, check out

00:01:45.790 --> 00:01:47.350
the Cloud documentation.

00:01:47.350 --> 00:01:49.500
[MUSIC PLAYING]

